[[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in OFF\nposition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428180\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428915\">1048A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the ignition coils.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Ignition &#x27;coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428197\">A30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect the high tension leads from the ignition coil.</p><p>3. Undo the bolts (3a) and remove the ignition coils (3b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045010.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in OFF\nposition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428180\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428915\">1048A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the ignition coils.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Ignition &#x27;coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428197\">A30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and remove the ignition coils (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045011.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the ignition coils back in their\nhousings and tighten them using the bolts.</p><p>Connect the high tension leads to the ignition\ncoils.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nignition coils.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428915\">1048A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p>"],[6,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the ignition coils back in their\nhousings and tighten them using the bolts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections to the\nignition coils.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428915\">1048A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p>"]]